<%# The live-debate strip that hangs off the bottom of a feed card — Hoojah 2026
    (redesign Phase 1, Task 1.4), mockup ~248-252. Rendered by `hujahs/_hujah_card`
    whenever `hujah.active_debate` is present; renders nothing otherwise, so the call
    site can render it unconditionally.

    Locals: hujah.

    Visually this is a SECOND surface, not a continuation of the card's own padding —
    the mockup overlaps the strip's top edge under the card's bottom edge (`-mt-4`) so
    the two read as one continuous shape with the card's straight top corners and this
    strip's own bottom rounding (`rounded-b-2xl`). It takes the `bg-disagree-soft`
    accent wash rather than the mockup's plain `bg-card`, marking it as a debate zone —
    the same "soft" stance tint `ui/_avatar`'s tile and the vote pills already use
    elsewhere in this redesign, not a new colour.

    Deliberately NOT the mockup's "Round 2 · 1,204 watching" second line: there is no
    watcher-count data anywhere in this app, so it is not invented here. The single
    line this renders instead — "@challenger vs @opponent · Round N" — carries
    everything `debate.current_round` and the two usernames can actually support.

    The Live pill's dot animates via the SAME `hbreathe` keyframe `application.css`
    already defines for the mockup's other pulsing dots (no new keyframe). It is an
    inline `style:`, not a Tailwind utility, because a bare CSS `animation` shorthand
    referencing a bespoke `@keyframes` name has no Tailwind class to reach for. %>
<% if (debate = hujah.active_debate) %>
  <%= link_to debate_path(debate.slug),
        class: "-mt-4 relative z-0 block rounded-b-2xl bg-disagree-soft shadow px-3.5 pt-6 pb-3 " \
               "flex items-center gap-2.5 no-underline" do %>
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[10px] font-extrabold tracking-wide uppercase text-white bg-disagree px-2 py-1 rounded-full shrink-0">
      <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-white block" style="animation: hbreathe 2s ease-in-out infinite"></span>
      Live
    </span>
    <div class="flex-1 min-w-0 text-sm font-bold text-ink truncate">
      @<%= debate.challenger.username %> vs @<%= debate.opponent.username %> · Round <%= debate.current_round %>
    </div>
    <%= lucide_icon("chevron-right", class: "w-5 h-5 text-faint shrink-0") %>
  <% end %>
<% end %>
